 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "roles lists n distinct role names; parents[i] lists the distinct roles that roles[i] inherits from (the inheritance graph is acyclic); allowed[i] and disallowed[i] list privilege names for roles[i]. The final privilege set of a role is (its allowed privileges plus the final privileges of every parent) minus its disallowed privileges, so a disallow overrides both its own allow and anything inherited, and a role inherits only what its parents finally hold. Return, for each role in input order, its final privileges sorted by code point.",
  "provenance": [
   {
